---
export const prerender = true;
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Revisionist, Industrialist & Factual Obsessive."
	pubDate={new Date('February 18 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I am a <strong>Centrist Revisionist</strong> (Social-Liberal, certified) who occasionally switches to an anarchist mindset when my core values are challenged. I am a staunch advocate for digital freedom, open-source collaboration, environmental sustainability, and the profound elegance found in <strong>silence and asynchronous workflows</strong>. 
	</p>

	<p>
		By profession, I "bake cakes" (build engineering logic and structural protocols) in the <strong>FMT (Facility Management Technology)</strong> industry. My current trajectory involves a deep transition between Engineering and Industrial paradigms (E&I transition), always seeking the absolute architecture hidden beneath the surface of complex systems.
	</p>

	<p>
		I describe myself as a <strong>135° Youth</strong>—an angle that represents my refusal to align with traditional polarities. I am a chronic patient of <em>Chunibyo</em> (ちゅうにびょう), finding meaning in the "stream of consciousness" rather than the mundane "West Coast" patterns. I have a severe case of "厭蠢症" (Aversion to stupidity), cured only by the precision of factual analysis and the relentless pursuit of truth.
	</p>

	<blockquote>
		"I'm volatile, self-obsessed, and don't play well with others."
	</blockquote>

	<p>
		As a <strong>Factual Obsessive</strong>, I don't follow the crowd. I don't engage in meaningless debates with the shallow or the closed-minded. If you're looking for an objective perspective or a cold splash of reality, you've found the right place. I believe in passion, heat, and the invariant echoes that connect the underlying protocols of history to the future order.
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li>#Revisionist #SocialLiberal #BareMetal</li>
		<li>#FMT #Factualist #Paranoid</li>
		<li>#EcoFriendly #OpenSource #AsyncLife</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		I am <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">S'ALL Running Man</span>. In this endless marathon, I deconstruct archives and engineering limits to capture the signals within the noise.
	</p>

	<hr class="my-10 border-border/60" />

	<div class="space-y-8">
		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">命名文化与数字身份 (Identity & Nomenclature)</h2>
			<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-sm pt-2">
				<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border space-y-1">
					<div class="text-xs text-primary font-bold">[ 号 · 霈泽 ]</div>
					<div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
						润物降泽，厚积薄发。代表稳健立足于实体商业、云基础设施与交付治理之号。
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border space-y-1">
					<div class="text-xs text-primary font-bold">[ 字 · 霂之 ]</div>
					<div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
						细雨润物，潜心钻研。代表探求底层协议、技术沉淀与人文精神内核之字。
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border space-y-1">
					<div class="text-xs text-primary font-bold">[ ID · Geniux ]</div>
					<div class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
						全网统一数字身份凭据。贯穿开源社区、智能体操作系统与数字矩阵的工程符号。
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">执行主义交付哲学 (Relentless Executionism)</h2>
			<blockquote class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-muted/40 border-l-4 border-primary text-foreground font-medium text-base not-italic">
				“既定目标不能改变：执行、发现问题、修正方法、继续执行。”
			</blockquote>
			<p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
				拒绝沉溺于不着边际的宏大叙事与虚妄讨论。从中国早期互联网车库现场到下一代智能体操作系统（Agentic OS）内核研发，真正的技术壁垒与商业价值，永远诞生于真实泥土中不妥协的高频交付与迭代闭环。
			</p>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
